<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle market quiet - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle market quiet - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade early Friday was quiet, with no sales slaughter steers or heifers confirmed, USDA said. Inquiry and demand light. This week's confirmed sales 56,900 head including 8,800 head or about 15 percent previously contracted or formulated cattle.</p>
<p>Confirmed - none.</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
</text>
